<title>USA: Dresser SubSea unit gets contract.</title>
<headline>Dresser SubSea unit gets contract.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SubSea Offshore Ltd said Friday it has been awarded a multi-million pound contract by Mobil Corp affiliate Mobil North Sea Ltd for the supply and operation of two purpose-built remotely operated vehicles to support Mobil's forthcoming exploration program.</p>
<p>SubSea, a subsidiary of Dresser Industries Inc did not specify the amount of the contract.</p>
<p>The drilling program is scheduled for the Tranch 6 area West of Shetland near Faroes border, SubSea said.</p>
</text>
